      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCESS DOCKER (4) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including three wins and two placings. Scored by a nose last time (23.28) in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. COBBLESTONE ROAD (6) was a big winner two back scoring by 4.5 lengths then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 5.5 lengths at Maitland (22.44). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Hard to beat again. SAVINA (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 23.02 beating Dollar Rolex. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. One of the prime contenders. SHE WILL KICK (2) profiles nicely over this trip.",
